  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Overflowing Bars</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 將 Minecraft 的生命值、護甲值和護甲強度條擴展到原版之上，同時保持精簡且易於閱讀。該模組不會增加額外的圖示行，而是將數值條分層疊加，佔用更少的畫面空間。📊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當您的數值超過原版限制時，層數計數器會精確顯示您擁有幾層生命值、護甲或護甲強度。無需記憶顏色方案或猜測當前查看的是哪一層。🔢 與許多替代 HUD 模組不同，它僅使用單一高亮顏色來表示堆疊層數。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">該模組還新增了一個專用的護甲強度條，將原版未顯示的重要防禦屬性納入 HUD。🛡️ 這在擁有高護甲和護甲強度值的重度模組遊戲中尤其實用。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">緊凑的生命值顯示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將生命值超過十顆心時疊加顯示，無需在 HUD 中增加額外行。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">超越原版限制的護甲：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅用必要的空間顯示高護甲值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">護甲強度條：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增專用護甲強度顯示，讓您隨時掌握這項重要防禦屬性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔢 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">清晰的層數計數器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每個疊加條均可顯示數字指示器，精準提示當前層數。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">易讀的顏色設計：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以原版顏色為基底層，僅使用單一高亮色代表疊層，避免令人困惑的彩虹色顯示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📏 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">節省空間的 HUD：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">即使生命值、護甲或護甲強度極高，仍保持緊凑。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟所有榮譽歸於原始模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars</a></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">相較原始模組新增內容：坐騎生命條相容、Random Things 的火符咒相容、以及更多功能</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
